{"id":197533,"name":"JVP,4MBDR","headline":"Sundown Symphony 4MBDR Villa @ Joubal El Gouna","summary":"This lagoon front 4 bedroom villa is located in Gouna's beloved Joubal  community and features a private pool along with a guest / maid’s bedroom. ","description":{"Space":"\r\n\r\nThis lagoon front 4 bedroom villa is located in Gouna's beloved Joubal  community and features a private pool along with a guest / maid’s bedroom. \r\n\r\nThe ground level features an open plan fully equipped kitchen, maid’s room, dining area and a living room. \r\n\r\nIt also features a 65 inch smart TV with Airplay and cable channels, washing machine, a Nespresso machine, kettle and a microwave. \r\n\r\nThe first level features 4 separate beautifully decorated bedrooms with king size beds. Additionally there are a total of 4 full bathrooms. \r\n\r\nThe styling of the villa is tailored to give the guests a relaxing and a unique vibe.\r\n\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\nGuests have access to the entire property\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\nWe are more than happy to answer all of your questions 24/7. Guests can text and call anytime they need help and our team will be there in about 30 mins to solve any issue immediately.\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\n\r\n-Joubal is a center point from Abu Tig Marina. \r\n- Joubal Lagoon located 35 minutes away from Hurghada international airport. \r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\nFree outdoor parking is available. \r\nTuktuks are available to take you anywhere in El Gouna (flat fee).\r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\nPlease note that smoking is not allowed inside the apartment. A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors.\r\n\r\n-Marina area and boats are not included in your rental and guests are not allowed over there.\r\n\r\n-No Guests are allowed to park on the left hand side of the parking\r\n\r\n-Guest parking is on your right hand side only.\r\n"},"city":"El Gouna","capacity_of_guests":8,"number_of_bedrooms":4,"number_of_beds":8,"number_of_bathrooms":5,"number_of_stars":4,"location_address1":"El Gouna, Hurghada, Red Sea Governorate 1982710","location_address2":"","location_lat":"27.41549","location_lng":"33.66727","booking_link":null,"airbnb_link":null,"rental_type":"villa","featured":false,"cleaning_fee":35,"checkin_time":15,"checkout_time":11,"booking_sync_cleaning_fee_id":417280,"active":1,"can_book":1,"agreement":"• Kindly note that a damage deposit of USD 200 (or the equivalent in EGP) is required. The payment is collected online as part of the reservation payment and will be reimbursed on the checkout day, provided no damages are incurred.\r\n  • Smoking (including shisha) inside the unit is strictly not allowed. However it is allowed in the unit’s balcony (if applicable). A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors.\r\n • Partying, excessive noise and public alcohol drinking is not allowed. In case of violations, security will be notified and appropriate strict actions will be taken. \r\n • Visitors are not allowed, only confirmed guests stated in the reservation will be granted entry. \r\n• Egyptian & Arab couples ONLY are required to provide proof of marriage according to Egyptian law. Guests are required to send their IDs or passports to the email (id@xurustays.com) or (id.elgouna@xurustays.com) as per the local regulations.\r\n• El Gouna entry permits require 48 hours to be issued, in case guest IDs and passports are sent less than 48 hours before check in date, entry permits are subject to delay or may not be granted. (In case of disapproval from community security office, guests will be fully refunded).\r\n • Cancellation more than 30 days before the arrival date, we keep 10% of the total price of the stay.\r\n • Cancellation between 15 days and 30 days before the arrival date, we keep 50%