42,"review":"Amazing experience 💓","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z"},{"id":5242995,"review":"excellent relaxing destination","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5246387,"review":"We enjoyed our stay, good location and good facilities and cooperative gust service team.","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z"},{"id":5261646,"review":"Amazing stay highly recommended","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z"},{"id":5269228,"review":"Smooth check in and professional team","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5304482,"review":"Avoid at any cost they are not honest  , call center not responding staff not helpful they didnt get security clearance for gates after driving 4 hours they send me message no clearance granted as we having hard time communicating with the owner i had to wait 2 hours and tried to manage new booking for last minute as alot of listings need 24 hours to approve the request \nSo my vacation was ruined and waste day with my kids trapped in the car\n\nThey are very rude as they claim its not mandatory to get you secuirty clearance to pass the security gates or giving you a pass code for gates for checking in","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5395560,"review":"We had an amazing stay at this villa in El Gouna! The location is perfect – just a short ride to downtown and to the kitesurfing schools, which was a huge plus for our group. The villa itself is spacious, comfortable, and ideal for both families and groups of friends. The host was incredibly helpful and responsive, making the whole experience even better. Highly recommend staying here for anyone looking to enjoy El Gouna to the fullest!","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z"},{"id":5533026,"review":"It was great","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":5586704,"review":"Great location","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5603655,"review":"Brilliant team, brilliant hospitality, brilliant communication, extremely and highly recommended","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5627816,"review":"The communication was friendly and swift.\nThe kitchen and bathrooms could have been better equipped. We mainly ate outside so didnt mind that mind.\nClose by to the kitespots and quiet neighbourhood was a plus.","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5635382,"review":"Place was perfect location and clean\nHelpful and usual fast response from host","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5669380,"review":"Beautiful home, really enjoyed the stay. Host was very helpful and responsive, even helping to reunite us with a bag we left behind. We really appreciate it. Thank you. Highly recommend a stay here.","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5714806,"review":"Enjoyed staying a the airbnb alot! The communication with the host was very easy and fast, anything that we needed was provided when we asked. The view and location was gorgeous! The villa was very quiet and near all the activities in the area ( beach, restaurant, marina etc)","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5740462,"review":"xuru is very nice place very good for familys and the most perfect thing that every bedroom has it’s own bathroom , the only comment that the location xuru sent is little bit wrong it shows the other side of the road","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5807559,"review":"Everything was great!","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z"},{"id":5825152,"review":"Lovely spacious villa, great pool, very responsive hosts. Comfy beds and good outside space. Good quality linen and nice touches of shampoo and shower gel provided.\nWe did have an issue with the air-conditioning omitting a bad smell particularly in the top bedroom and sitting room. However, the hosts were exceedingly responsive to our concerns and we had maintenance men visit us quite a few times over the course of a few days to try and resolve the problem. Despite all the hard work they were not able to resolve the issue which led to us not being able to use the air-conditioning in the top bedroom and the sitting room But I am certain that they will do going forwards. The kitchen in particular could do with a little updating, couple of the cupboards had wonky cupboard doors and there were a lack of mugs (only 3)and general equipment within this area. I would definitely return once I was aware that the air-conditioning have been fixed. Many thanks for a good stay.","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5850941,"review":"Wir hatten hier leider keinen angenehmen Aufenthalt, da die gesamte Villa einen starken Geruch nach Feuchtigkeit und Fäkalien aufwies, die Unterkunft war auch insgesamt nicht besonders sauber. Die Bilder hier bei AirBNB sehen sehr viel schöner aus als die Realität. Das einzige, was positiv war, war die Kommunikation mit dem Anbieter, da er stets schnell geantwortet hat. Wir waren froh, dass wir Stornieren und das Haus nach einer Nacht verlassen konnten.","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5851245,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":6023943,"review":"Everything was perfect.. timely responses and proactive, but we wish we had the pool cleaned up before we come..","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6142316,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197533,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}